# Store every file exactly as it is, with no line-ending conversion on any platform. The CK3 mod files are generated
# with CRLF line endings and a UTF-8 BOM, and the generator check (node tools/gen/gen_ck3_mod.mjs --check) and several
# tests compare exact bytes, so a checkout must be byte-identical to what was committed.
* -text
*.jpg binary
*.png binary
*.ico binary
